# The Seawall


At low tide the harbour wall <!-- page: 2 -->stood dry above the slipway.


Nets hang over the rail to dry before the tide turns.


<!-- page: 4 -->

The last boat is in by dusk.


# The Lamp Room


A single lamp burns above the door all night.


